---
config:
  sequence:
    scopedFrames: true
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    participant C as Carol
    A->>+B: open session
    alt acquire the lock
        B->>C: lock
        C-->>B: granted
    else timeout
        B->>C: retry
    end
    loop poll
        B->>C: status
    end
    B-->>-A: done
